0.30 & 0.80 (large) & 9.94\; $[8.39,\; 16.65]$ & 1.02 (large) & 2.62\; $[1.72,\; 3.65]$ \\ % exp_id: bf16_ds_imp_s030, bf16_qw_imp_s030; per-problem paired B=10000; d_z from cohens_d_bf16.json + cohens_d_bf16_qwen.json
